vcpkg 2026.07.29, port gmp: MSYS2's autoconf2.71-2.71-4 instead of 2.71-3.

On Windows the gmp port builds with MSYS2's autoconf 2.71, which it pins by
URL and SHA512. MSYS2 replaced autoconf2.71-2.71-3 with 2.71-4 and deleted
the old file from every mirror (404, October 2026), so the pinned release
can no longer build gmp on Windows. Upstream vcpkg made exactly this change
to ports/gmp/portfile.cmake after the 2026.07.29 release; the SHA512 is
that of the 2.71-4 package on repo.msys2.org.

tools/backends/pins.sh applies vcpkg-*.patch files to copies of the ports
they touch and uses those as overlay ports (Windows only).

Source: https://github.com/microsoft/vcpkg (MIT).

